+
+**Fix:** Dialog now resolves `meal` from the live `meals` query (`meals.find(m => m.id === mealSnapshot.id) ?? mealSnapshot`). Fork case handled by updating `mealDetail.meal.id` to the fork ID inside `handleUpliftAccepted`.
