+**Date:** 2026-06-12
+**Branch:** main
+**Rollback tag:** `rollback/pre-phase2-normal-meal-compatibility`
+**Rollback commit:** `43fbdda` (checkpoint: pre-nutrition-boost-provenance rollback point)
+**Status:** COMPLETE — PASS
