+# Household Compatibility Phase 6 — Compatibility-Aware Ranking Plan
+
+**Date:** 2026-06-12
+**Branch:** main
+**Rollback tag:** `pre-phase6-compatibility-ranking`
+**Rollback commit:** `43fbdda31863fba2ffdc33c3dbb96d36544e22d1`
