+# Household Compatibility Phase 6 — Compatibility-Aware Ranking: Implementation Report
+
+**Date:** 2026-06-12
+**Branch:** main
+**Status:** COMPLETE — PASS
+
+---
+
+## 1. Rollback Identifier
