+---
+
+## Scope
+
+This fix is strictly limited to removing the conditional `enabled` guard on the uplift applications query.
+
+No changes to:
+- Endpoint
+- Schema
+- Fork logic
+- Boost generation
+- Remove endpoint
+- Ingredient persistence
+- Compact boost rows
+- Add button
