+| Breakfast (7 slots) | 0 filled, 7 empty* | **7 filled** (if ≥1 external breakfast candidate passes Vegan filter) |
+| Lunch (7 slots) | 7 filled | 7 filled |
+| Dinner (7 slots) | 7 filled | 7 filled |
+| **Total** | **14/21** | **21/21** |
