+
+**Key logic (simplified):**
+
+```ts
+const SMART_SESSION_VERSION = 2;
+
+// on load:
+if (!data.version || data.version < SMART_SESSION_VERSION) {
+  sessionStorage.removeItem(SMART_SESSION_KEY);
+  return null;
+}
+if (!Array.isArray(data.smartResult?.entries)) {
+  sessionStorage.removeItem(SMART_SESSION_KEY);
+  return null;
+}
+```
