+- Mobile view: stacked day cards (`sm:hidden`)  
+- Desktop view: 7-column horizontal-scroll grid (`hidden sm:block overflow-x-auto`)  
+- Tablet (768px): gets the desktop grid in a horizontal scroll box — uncomfortably cramped
